screen.VOLUMETRICS=Volumetric Light
option.SHADOW_RECEIVER_PLANE=Near Shadow Correction
value.SHADOW_RECEIVER_PLANE.0=Off
value.SHADOW_RECEIVER_PLANE.1=On
option.SHADOW_RECEIVER_PLANE.comment=Corrects shadow sample depths using the geometric surface to reduce slope acne and detached contacts. Normal maps still affect material lighting. Off restores the previous bias; on by default.
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT=Sun Shafts
value.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.0=Off
value.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.1=On
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.comment=Sunlight scattered in air below the cloud base, occluded by foliage, terrain and clouds. Works with the sun off screen. Disabled at night, full rain and underwater; preserves the existing sky halo.
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Shaft Strength
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Controls only directional scattering in air, without changing sky, surface or moonlight brightness. Default 1.0.
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT_SAMPLES=Shaft Quality
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT_SAMPLES.comment=24 / 32 / 48 shadow integration samples, default 32; denser nearby, up to 128 blocks. Higher quality improves thin forest shafts at additional cost.
screen.MATERIALS=Materials
option.SSR_TRACE_STEPS=Reflection Trace Steps
option.SSR_TRACE_STEPS.comment=24 / 32 / 48 adaptive probe budget including local refinement and hit validation; water and ice fade to the environment by 128 blocks. More budget helps complex occlusion at extra cost.
option.SSR_TEMPORAL=Reflection Temporal Stability
option.SSR_TEMPORAL.comment=Half-resolution history stabilizes validated water, ice and puddle hits. Hidden or off-screen geometry uses the environment, never stale color. Off disables the commit pass and releases the large history allocations.
value.SSR_TEMPORAL.0=Off
value.SSR_TEMPORAL.1=On
option.REFLECTION_CLOUDS=Clouds in Reflections
option.REFLECTION_CLOUDS.comment=Fast cloud-column approximation using the sky weather, wind and light. At most three noise reads; grazing rays fade into the sky. Does not reconstruct off-screen buildings or trees.
value.REFLECTION_CLOUDS.0=Off
value.REFLECTION_CLOUDS.1=On
screen.WATER=Water
option.SHORE_FOAM=Shore Foam
value.SHORE_FOAM.0=Off
value.SHORE_FOAM.1=On
option.SHORE_FOAM.comment=Broken foam near shallow bottoms and banks, animated by existing waves and lit by the local lightmap. Uses visible opaque geometry; hidden banks may lose foam. Skips deep water, underwater views and waterfall sides.
option.SHORE_FOAM_STRENGTH=Foam Strength
option.SHORE_FOAM_STRENGTH.comment=Controls coverage without changing shore width. Preserves water reflections and transparent layers. Use zero for visual comparisons and Off for GPU comparisons.
screen.WEATHER=Weather and Wetness
option.SURFACE_WETNESS=Surface Wetness
value.SURFACE_WETNESS.0=Off
value.SURFACE_WETNESS.1=On
option.SURFACE_WETNESS.comment=Rain darkens soil, masonry and wood with material-specific roughness and gradual drying. Sky light levels approximate shelter; eaves and transparent roofs may be inaccurate. Basic material changes add no texture reads; puddle reflections have a separate switch.
option.SURFACE_WETNESS_STRENGTH=Wetness Strength
option.SURFACE_WETNESS_STRENGTH.comment=Adjust darkening and sheen. Soil stays rough; masonry becomes smoother. Preserves specular normal filtering. Use strength 0 for color comparison, or disable wetness for GPU cost comparison.
option.PUDDLE_REFLECTIONS=Puddle Reflections
value.PUDDLE_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.PUDDLE_REFLECTIONS.1=On
option.PUDDLE_REFLECTIONS.comment=Local exposed horizontal pools reflect visible trees/buildings and dry gradually. Stronger on masonry, weaker on sand. Nearby screen-space search with sky fallback for missing geometry. Adds GPU work but reuses existing buffers; disabling keeps basic wetness.
screen.NATURE=Clouds and Vegetation
option.CLOUD_STYLE=Cloud Style
value.CLOUD_STYLE.0=Block Volumetric Clouds
value.CLOUD_STYLE.1=Natural Volumetric Clouds
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Block clouds have world-space volume and interior texture. Natural clouds use continuous masses, fine erosion and directional self-shadow. Surface shadows and reflected clouds follow the selected style.
option.CLOUD_SAMPLES=Natural Cloud Quality
option.CLOUD_SAMPLES.comment=Volume integration samples for natural clouds, default 20. Higher values improve interiors and outlines at extra cost. Block clouds use independent cell-boundary traversal.
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS=Surface Cloud Shadows
value.CLOUD_SHADOWS.0=Off
value.CLOUD_SHADOWS.1=On
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS.comment=Reuses cloud coverage/wind to attenuate standard sun/moon surface lighting. At most 3 extra noise reads per applicable fragment, with no new buffer. Fades near the horizon; contrast softens in rain/night.
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_STRENGTH=Cloud Shadow Strength
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_STRENGTH.comment=Controls cloud attenuation of direct light. Dense shadows have a smooth contrast bound, reduced in rain/night to avoid repeated darkening.
option.VEGETATION_TRANSMISSION=Vegetation Transmission
value.VEGETATION_TRANSMISSION.0=Off
value.VEGETATION_TRANSMISSION.1=On
option.VEGETATION_TRANSMISSION.comment=Local thin-surface backlighting for leaves and plants, reusing existing shadow taps. No thickness/SSS texture reads. Respects clouds, weather, sky light and blockers; does not boost ambient lighting.
option.VEGETATION_TRANSMISSION_STRENGTH=Vegetation Transmission Strength
option.VEGETATION_TRANSMISSION_STRENGTH.comment=Peak backlighting is limited by the material diffuse budget and weakens in rain/night. Higher values do not bypass blockers or boost ambient light.
screen.STABILITY=Highlight and Edge Stability
option.SPECULAR_AA=Specular Anti-aliasing
option.SPECULAR_AA.comment=Filters highlights using pixel normal variation, widening the lobe and reducing peaks. Set 0 for comparison; water details still fade with pixel footprint.
option.DYNAMIC_AA_STRENGTH=Dynamic Edge AA Strength
option.DYNAMIC_AA_STRENGTH.comment=Spatial AA for moving objects and temporarily unavailable history. Lower values retain more sharpness but may shimmer. Does not temporally accumulate moving geometry.
screen.LIGHTING=Lighting Baseline
screen.COLOR=Exposure and Color
option.MATERIAL_MODE=Material Format
value.MATERIAL_MODE.0=Vanilla
value.MATERIAL_MODE.1=LabPBR
option.MATERIAL_MODE.comment=Vanilla skips normal/specular maps. Select LabPBR for compatible resource packs. Supports normals, roughness, F0/metals and AO; texture emission, POM and texture SSS are not yet supported. Held items remain Lightmap-only.
option.DIRECT_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Sun/Moon Direct Light
option.LIGHTMAP_STRENGTH=Vanilla Ambient Lighting
option.LIGHTMAP_STRENGTH.comment=Scales the Lightmap ambient term, including block and vanilla sky light. Sky visibility does not suppress this term in caves.
option.DAY_SKY_LIGHTMAP=Daytime Sky Lightmap Fill
option.DAY_SKY_LIGHTMAP.comment=Reduces clear-day vanilla sky fill for distinct sun and shade. Preserves block light; restores the original contribution at night and softens contrast in rain. Default 0.45.
option.SKY_AMBIENT_STRENGTH=Sky Fill Light
option.SKY_AMBIENT_STRENGTH.comment=Additional sky diffuse and specular lighting, gated by the surface sky-light level. Does not affect block emission.
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Strength
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the compact, soft glow. Zero skips Bloom texture work; both passes and buffers remain allocated.
option.BLOOM_THRESHOLD=Bloom Threshold
option.COLOR_CONTRAST=Contrast
option.COLOR_VIBRANCE=Vibrance
option.COLOR_SATURATION=Saturation
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Linear HDR multiplier after adding Bloom and before tone mapping. Default: 0.92.
option.COLOR_CONTRAST.comment=Neutral comparison: contrast 1, vibrance 0, saturation 1, Bloom strength 0.

screen.LOCAL_LIGHTS=Local Lights
option.SHADOW_CSM=Cascaded Shadows (CSM)
option.SHADOW_CSM.comment=On by default. A 4096 atlas with 8/32/96/192 block radii doubles near precision without enlarging the atlas. Off restores fisheye shadows.
value.SHADOW_CSM.0=Off
value.SHADOW_CSM.1=On
option.LOCAL_LIGHT=Held Item Lights
option.LOCAL_LIGHT.comment=Two approximate hand anchors with spherical attenuation and material shading. Placed sources have a separate switch.
option.LOCAL_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Local Light Strength
option.LOCAL_LIGHT_SHADOWS=Local Light Shadows
option.LOCAL_LIGHT_SHADOWS.comment=Placed sources use current-frame scene occluders and cached shadows, including off-screen geometry. Held sources retain screen contact shadows.

option.PLACED_LIGHTS=Placed Block Lights

option.PLACED_LIGHTS.comment=On by default. Torches, lanterns, soul lights and lit redstone lamps use spherical attenuation and nearby dynamic shadows. Distant light retains the vanilla lightmap.
